{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Corridors of Their Memories</i> is a short visual novel in the thriller and detective genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in 2022, when the FBI begins using new technology that reads residual neural signals. Scientists have discovered how memory is stored and learned to extract it. Agents can now see everything the victim saw \u2014 including the attacker\u2019s face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >John Victor, a former police officer, must solve a case as part of the examination to transfer into Unit V, which specializes in using this technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether he succeeds depends entirely on your decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 A focused story about a single crime<br>\u2605 A narrative that reacts to your choices<br>\u2605 Numerous decisions requiring memory interpretation<br>\u2605 3 different endings<br>\u2605 True Ending unlocks after the first playthrough</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"2ed71a8ac717f52e711142648aeb89df5c609b09.jpg","localized_name":"Quiet house","name":"Quiet house","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1371040/2ed71a8ac717f52e711142648aeb89df5c609b09.jpg"},{"icon":"6c4ecec053ebc5db4dc1f4c9bf076a4dd39a155f.jpg","localized_name":"Your soul is mine","name":"Your soul is mine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1371040/6c4ecec053ebc5db4dc1f4c9bf076a4dd39a155f.jpg"},{"icon":"43757c6ca63de8ff4c5e46b55e4429e8004e1f0e.jpg","localized_name":"Rainy day","name":"Rainy day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1371040/43757c6ca63de8ff4c5e46b55e4429e8004e1f0e.jpg"},{"icon":"4ab8c19e89900b5ea97ccdb77640f6fdfa24106a.jpg","localized_name":"Child trauma","name":"Child trauma","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1371040/4ab8c19